Cell["\<\
The ray from the centre of a grid through a vertex two steps up and two \
across. Past that vertex it spreads until it reaches the corner, where no \
step leads farther away: 36 rays.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e7caca30-18cd-456d-8697-baceaf57e429"],

